      "description": "Typographic crimson project panel with fine diamond geometry.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-rvlry\" href=\"#rvlry\" aria-label=\"Play RVLRY\"><span class=\"ds-edge\">GOOD FRIENDS. GREAT RIVALS.</span><span class=\"ds-rvlry-logo\">RVLRY<span>.</span></span><span class=\"ds-tagline\">One more round?</span><span class=\"ds-open\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12\"/></svg></span><span class=\"ds-diamond ds-one\"></span><span class=\"ds-diamond ds-two\"></span></a>",
